# INTERPRETATION
# Probe 1 clean  => ToolCallViewProps.inputActions.submit(): void is well typed
#                   on the SAME props type src/client/VisualizeCard.tsx receives.
# Probe 2 clean  => the @ts-expect-error on a nonexistent property was SATISFIED,
#                   so the probe distinguishes present from absent. Had that
#                   property existed, tsc would report an unused @ts-expect-error
#                   and this run would not be clean.
# Probe 3 fails  => `inputActions` is strongly typed as InputActions, NOT `any`.
#                   Without this the positive probe would prove nothing: an
